a","children":["Taung"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Taung","referenceId":"reference:20d606b23d4fb1ae"}," Species remain, as well as alien converts. They travel and fight and strive to live their lives in accordance with the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Resol'Nare"]},". For the Crusaders- derisively called \"Paleo-Crusaders\" by the Neo-Crusaders- this is enough to fill a life.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Crusaders in the field are responsible for their own provisioning, carrying their whole worlds on their back. Likewise, division of labor sorts itself out organically. A Crusader who wants to run an artillery unit of fly a ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Davaab"]},"-Type Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Davaab-Type_Starfighter","referenceId":"reference:734705f2a769bd4e"}," just shows up and does it- and does it better than anyone else if they want to keep doing it. The Crusaders have little tolerance for bureaucracy and none at all for incompetence. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["No two suits of Crusader Armor are identical, internally or externally. They are the most visible symbol of a movement prizing individualism.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Mandalorian Crusader Statistics (CL 3)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soldier","referenceId":"reference:f826baa05bef6921"}," 3\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +6; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Low-Light Vision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Low-Light_Vision"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"